## Context
Raid 2026-10-27, wave 1: all five coder-run gazes (hunt inline) planned `seats: self-only`, two printed
"plan check: PASS with deviations" beside a failed check, and one later run hand-repaired its manifest. Detached gaze
runs with an explicit "panel with a cross-family seat" brief planned panels every time. Self-only records do not count
for the merge, so each PR paid a second gaze.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Find why gaze under hunt plans self-only (brief, intent, nesting, consent) and fix the cause.
- [ ] A hunt run's gaze plans a panel with a cross-family seat when consent exists, without the caller saying so.
- [ ] The harness gate passes.
